{"2981920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keaton's Adventure", "steam_appid": 2981920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the collision of the Milky Way and Andromeda Galaxy. Milkdromeda is born, simultaneously reviving an ancient culture and scattering fragments of power throughout the stars. You play as either Keaton or his lovable partner, Garden, who become &quot;UltraKin&quot;, a super-powered community of altruists who share and carry out the will of the Galaxy-- A desire in which to provide for and protect all living things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE TO RECOVER ULTRA SHARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8fab19179cadd6196e998fba097579d3.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8fab19179cadd6196e998fba097579d3.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8fab19179cadd6196e998fba097579d3.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lost fragments of power belonging to the Galaxy against an opportunistic invasion lead by an unknown entity to provide disaster relief for strife-ridden civilizations along your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVERSE THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/e9c202c3b2c72153154059c40aa9f6b7.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/e9c202c3b2c72153154059c40aa9f6b7.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/e9c202c3b2c72153154059c40aa9f6b7.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover different types of planets with unique environments and meet charming characters that inhabit them. Uncover hidden lore and truths about the nature of galaxies and the universe as you save those in need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER A DIVERSE MOVESET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/76e761c3f347b07a09d65a6d48f60bbf.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/76e761c3f347b07a09d65a6d48f60bbf.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/76e761c3f347b07a09d65a6d48f60bbf.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move energetically throughout sprawling regions with various abilities at your disposal! Combat enemies, pull off dazzling tricks, and solve puzzles as you gradually gain access to even more mobility options to overcome alien terrain! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN FORCES IN LOCAL CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/250748e0b0cfbfb0acd664c4a7200983.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/250748e0b0cfbfb0acd664c4a7200983.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/250748e0b0cfbfb0acd664c4a7200983.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the battlefield with another UltraKin! 2 players can seamlessly experience the story together. Easily drop in and out of gameplay at the press of a button. You can compete or cooperate for the best score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTABLES AND EQUIPMENT COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8bf99c37747d03e0b7be9e7c64d610a7.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8bf99c37747d03e0b7be9e7c64d610a7.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8bf99c37747d03e0b7be9e7c64d610a7.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various items exist to aid you on your adventure! Spice up how you like to play by mixing and matching different combinations of stat modifying equipment. Utilize Power ups to navigate difficult situations, and make use of objects in your surroundings to solve problems your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Solar Systems to Discover </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Planets to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Hand Crafted Regions (Levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat Altering Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Save Files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Character Movesets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Chains</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the collision of the Milky Way and Andromeda Galaxy. Milkdromeda is born, simultaneously reviving an ancient culture and scattering fragments of power throughout the stars. You play as either Keaton or his lovable partner, Garden, who become &quot;UltraKin&quot;, a super-powered community of altruists who share and carry out the will of the Galaxy-- A desire in which to provide for and protect all living things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE TO RECOVER ULTRA SHARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8fab19179cadd6196e998fba097579d3.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8fab19179cadd6196e998fba097579d3.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8fab19179cadd6196e998fba097579d3.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lost fragments of power belonging to the Galaxy against an opportunistic invasion lead by an unknown entity to provide disaster relief for strife-ridden civilizations along your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVERSE THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/e9c202c3b2c72153154059c40aa9f6b7.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/e9c202c3b2c72153154059c40aa9f6b7.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/e9c202c3b2c72153154059c40aa9f6b7.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover different types of planets with unique environments and meet charming characters that inhabit them. Uncover hidden lore and truths about the nature of galaxies and the universe as you save those in need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER A DIVERSE MOVESET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/76e761c3f347b07a09d65a6d48f60bbf.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/76e761c3f347b07a09d65a6d48f60bbf.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/76e761c3f347b07a09d65a6d48f60bbf.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move energetically throughout sprawling regions with various abilities at your disposal! Combat enemies, pull off dazzling tricks, and solve puzzles as you gradually gain access to even more mobility options to overcome alien terrain! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN FORCES IN LOCAL CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/250748e0b0cfbfb0acd664c4a7200983.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/250748e0b0cfbfb0acd664c4a7200983.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/250748e0b0cfbfb0acd664c4a7200983.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the battlefield with another UltraKin! 2 players can seamlessly experience the story together. Easily drop in and out of gameplay at the press of a button. You can compete or cooperate for the best score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTABLES AND EQUIPMENT COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8bf99c37747d03e0b7be9e7c64d610a7.poster.avif?t=1763420632\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8bf99c37747d03e0b7be9e7c64d610a7.webm?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/extras/8bf99c37747d03e0b7be9e7c64d610a7.mp4?t=1763420632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various items exist to aid you on your adventure! Spice up how you like to play by mixing and matching different combinations of stat modifying equipment. Utilize Power ups to navigate difficult situations, and make use of objects in your surroundings to solve problems your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Solar Systems to Discover </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Planets to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Hand Crafted Regions (Levels)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat Altering Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Save Files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Character Movesets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo Chains</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Keaton's Adventure is an expressive 2D action-adventure platformer. Traverse the recently formed Milkdromeda Galaxy to bring about peace and stomp out an alien invasion!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981920/9780d1b310c71ccdbc71cbf33086f96e74ebf42d/header.jpg?t=1763420632", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akam